86
00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:21.995
Saya akui Yuk Junseo kuat.

87
00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:24.731
Apa khabar Yuk Junseo? Dia baik?

88
00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.499
Hanya kuasa mentah.

89
00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:28.701
Jadi bagaimana anda menghadapinya?
Apabila dia melempar,

90
00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:29.869
